.\" Manual page for the catalog example command.
.TH CATALOG 1 2026-11-10 "fb examples" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
catalog \- print labels for an in-memory file catalog
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B catalog
.RB [ \-s ]
.RI [ name ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B catalog
prints one label per entry, such as
.IR notes.md ,
followed by its size in bytes.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-s
Sort entries by size instead of by name.
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
$ catalog
notes.md: 120 bytes
letter.eml: 240 bytes
.EE
